{"confidence": null, "cue_index": 46, "end_sec": 333.0, "id": "TR_LIVE_20210622_003_asr_raw_zh_001_CUE_000046", "live_id": "LIVE_20210622_003", "source_cue_id": null, "speaker_entity_id": null, "start_sec": 323.0, "text": "所以兄弟姐妹们,这就是他们恐惧这个虚拟货币和加密货币的原因!共产党做的孽,终于报应了!", "timing_status": "asr", "transcript_version_id": "TR_LIVE_20210622_003_asr_raw_zh_001"}
